# nisse sudo mode FULL (the default). Everyone in the wheel group, which includes the first user the installer makes,
# runs any command as any user without a password. The AI works with no interruptions; so does any other program running
# as that user. Switch with: sudo nisse-sudo-mode limited
%wheel ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL
